    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44264" root="&#xA;                        هدى&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدْىٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A way, course, method, mode,</i> or <i>manner,
of acting,</i> or <i>conduct,</i> or <i>proceeding,</i> or <i>the like;</i>
(Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِدْيَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدْيَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) or
to the second and third: and the first is pl. [or
coll. gen. n.] of the last: (S:) and <i>a god way,</i>
&amp;c.: and <i>calm,</i> or <i>placid, deportment;</i> or <i>calmness,</i> or <i>placidity, of deportment:</i> (TA:) see also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدْىٌ</span> [<i>Conduct, mode of life; manners</i>]. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدِىٌّ</span>.

